  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus jusqu&apos;en d&#xe9;cembre 2024 : 2) am&#xe9;lioration des pratiques agricoles pour 93% (18,897/20,319) des m&#xe9;nages des cohortes 1-2-3; 3) am&#xe9;lioration des pratiques de gestion du b&#xe9;tail pour 84% (17,068/20,319) des m&#xe9;nages des cohortes 1-2-3-4; 4) 39% des femmes occupent des postes de leadership communautaire (2852/7245 postes); 5) 36% des jeunes occupent des postes de leadership communautaire (2580/7245 postes); et 6) 472 initiatives de d&#xe9;veloppement communautaire ont &#xe9;t&#xe9; lanc&#xe9;s par 530 associations villageoises d&apos;&#xe9;pargne et de cr&#xe9;dit dans les communaut&#xe9;s partenaires.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of December 2024 include: (1) 90% (12,278/13,642) of households (cohorts 1-2-3) feel the quality of their life has improved over the last 12 months; (2) 93% (18,897/20,319) of households (cohorts 1-2-3-4) improved their agricultural practices; (3) 84% (17,068/20,319) of households (cohorts 1-2-3-4) improved their livestock management practices; (4) 39% of women are in community leadership positions (2852/7245 positions); (5) 36% of youth are in community leadership positions (2580/7245 positions); and (6) 472 Community Driven Development initiatives were launched by 530 village savings and loan associations in partner communities.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) l&#x2019;augmentation de la production agricole et de l&#x2019;&#xe9;levage; 2) le renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s des femmes et des jeunes dans des zones difficiles d&#x2019;acc&#xe8;s &#xe0; assumer des r&#xf4;les de leadership communautaire et &#xe0; participer activement &#xe0; la prise de d&#xe9;cisions au sein des m&#xe9;nages et de la collectivit&#xe9;; 3) l&#x2019;augmentation des activit&#xe9;s g&#xe9;n&#xe9;ratrices de revenus gr&#xe2;ce &#xe0; des initiatives de d&#xe9;veloppement ax&#xe9;es sur la collectivit&#xe9;.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) increased agricultural crop and livestock productions; (2) increased  last-mile, women and youth capacities to take on community leadership roles and actively participate in household and community decision-making; and (3) increased income-generating activities through community-driven development initiatives.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
